OL,3,GNEWSADisruption warning ahead of       
OL,4,Arailway line closures                  
OL,6,FThe London Paddington lines will be    
OL,7,Fclosed on Saturday and Sunday (28 and  
OL,8,F29 November) for preparatory work. The 
OL,9,Fmain phase of work takes place between 
OL,10,FChristmas and New Year and is part of a
OL,11,Fwider programme of engineering upgrades
OL,12,Facross the Thames Valley.              
OL,14,FThe weekend closures will impact all   
OL,15,Ftrain services for London Paddington,  
OL,16,Fand Great Western Railway (GWR) warns  
OL,17,Fjourneys may take longer than usual.   
